your power backup needs.\",\"573743ba-bd29-40fc-80e6-cd6fa1ce085f\":\"Our Inverter Battery Range:\",\"a5d385c8-e00d-4be5-826d-5bd117552929\":\"Why Choose Livguard:\",\"f6ee6026-c1bc-4814-aaca-86b62c56080f\":\"Find the Right Inverter Battery for Your Office or Industrial Space:\",\"2d795937-f920-49a8-b19d-6cb8073d4db3\":\"Livguard's extensive range of inverter batteries, including 150Ah and 200Ah options, ensures that you find the perfect fit for your office, shop, or industrial power backup needs. Whether it's for backup power in your office, shop, or industrial facility, we have the solution.\",\"65b60823-257a-4725-99a7-77ce25e91288\":\"Explore Our Products for Office and Industrial Use:\",\"c842a2c6-1a3b-488e-a3ad-a668f45de854\":\"Experience Uninterrupted Power in Your Office or Industrial Space with Livguard:\",\"5956a05a-dd59-4e9a-aa1d-48aa55f236f5\":\"Don't let power interruptions disrupt your work. Livguard's inverter batteries are your reliable source of backup power for your office, shop, or industrial setup. Explore our range today and ensure uninterrupted power when you need it the most.\",\"86526c6c-8a27-4e06-b4fa-da1b82cc3967\":\"Livguard Solar - Your Comprehensive Destination for Power Solutions\",\"797afe89-61fe-487d-924e-2975a3e29b34\":\"Are you searching for the best inverter battery, solar solutions, automotive batteries, or E-mobility products for your home, office, or industrial needs? Look no further! Livguard offers a diverse range of high-quality power solutions, ensuring uninterrupted power supply in any setting.\",\"86184562-2338-4444-a867-bcabc36fd280\":\"Our Comprehensive Product Range:\",\"7e6f0e05-9a06-4a17-9f8c-3cbf7dc65cf9\":\"Why Choose Livguard Solar:\",\"2f3afb31-1745-461a-b06c-b6f82dad8007\":\"Finding the Right Power \\u0026 Solar Solution:\",\"29323849-e8a8-4a1c-9ef9-792453e5aab3\":\"Livguard's extensive product range ensures you find the ideal power \\u0026 solar solution for your home, office, or industrial space. Whether you require backup power, solar energy solutions, automotive batteries, or E-mobility products, we have you covered.\",\"2105f9c8-df34-4807-97d6-eb502582c907\":\"Explore Our Offerings:\",\"618931ac-9e6c-4492-b9d1-2243eabbb2b6\":\"Experience Uninterrupted Power with Livguard:\",\"ef416060-345e-45c1-a6cb-763e9e6a12b7\":\"Don't let power interruptions disrupt your daily life, work, or industrial processes. Livguard's power solutions, including inverter batteries, solar products, automotive batteries, and E-mobility solutions, are your reliable sources of energy. Explore our range today and ensure uninterrupted power when you need it the most.\",\"474e6e60-db1c-4c7e-b158-caf6a2425ee8\":\"Inverter Batteries for Home and Office: Find the perfect inverter for home, office, or shop use with Livguard. We offer a variety of options, including tubular batteries and 150Ah battery choices like short tubular and tall tubular, ensuring that your workspaces stay powered up efficiently.\",\"2f15fc7f-1e7f-4a5d-a97b-899fdb3062f3\":\"Best Inverter Battery: At Livguard, we take pride in providing the best inverter batteries on the market. Our extensive selection ensures you get the ideal combination of performance and value.\",\"8756b065-a52e-46d2-adfb-bc8ce1df4823\":\"Inverter Shops Near Me: Locate Livguard inverter batteries at stores near you. Our wide distribution network ensures that you can easily find inverter dealers nearby, whether for office or industrial use.\",\"53da8188-f07f-45dc-82fd-5ce27696264c\":\"Inverters for Offices: Need a compact power solution for your office or shop? Explore our range of mini inverters that are perfect for small spaces and low-power requirements.\",\"3bce3717-9177-40a1-8099-179e3f142d0a\":\"High-Capacity Batteries for Industrial Use: For those with higher power needs in industrial settings, our 200Ah batteries are a reliable choice. Get the best inverter with a battery for your industrial applications.\",\"ae660408-b213-4060-9059-3b53544297fa\":\"Sine Wave Inverters for Office and Industrial Use: Experience smooth and consistent power output with our sine wave inverters, ideal for sensitive electronic devices in office and industrial environments.\",\"6a5d55f0-21cd-47a8-8f9d-7c0e1ec61e95\":\"Hybrid Inverters for Office and Industrial Settings: Looking for a versatile solution for your office or industrial space? Consider our hybrid inverters that integrate solar power and grid electricity seamlessly.\",\"ba2310a2-9823-4536-8697-1cc83da9aa39\":\"Quality Assurance: Livguard is synonymous with quality. Our inverter batteries are built to last, ensuring long-term reliability and performance in both office and industrial settings.\",\"c174476d-747e-44a8-8af6-41a6e5f26c92\":\"Wide Variety for Office and Industrial Needs: No matter your specific requirements, we have an inverter and battery combination that fits your office or industrial power backup needs.\",\"9285e6dc-7554-4b8d-b83b-1c462f3b315a\":\"Expert Guidance: Our knowledgeable staff can guide you in selecting the perfect inverter and battery setup for your office, shop, or industrial setup.\",\"7da9aca6-1493-44e1-9a51-e79f9b4be665\":\"Competitive Prices: We offer competitive inverter battery prices, ensuring you get the best value for your money, whether it's for your office or industrial use.\",\"0a491c8b-0c8a-406c-a482-89b144758687\":\"Tubular Batteries: Discover the durability and performance of our tubular batteries, designed for long-lasting power backup in office and industrial settings.\",\"af744aeb-e34f-45e3-9372-27b08e600fbc\":\"Online Inverter \\u0026 Inverter Battery Shopping: Shop online at Livguard from the comfort of your office or home, and we'll deliver your chosen inverter battery right to your doorstep.\",\"dfa119d7-cdb6-46b8-83c4-9883e5a092b6\":\"Inverter Battery Accessories: Find inverter battery boxes, converters, and other accessories to complement your power setup, whether it's for your office, shop, or industrial facility.\",\"fdbebfc5-96