e\",\"f900391f-bcad-4185-adf2-ec61b74662fe\":\"2 BHK Home\",\"fb4c3130-3c4e-4f47-984d-977afcdd8380\":\"3 BHK Home\",\"68f6bb6e-b78e-4b1d-86d3-8eb004ee22cf\":\"How Our \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted tw-whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\u003eSolar Experts Deliver?\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"2768e014-aad2-4622-a7e0-39cd685d5be9\":\"Using the decades of research in the energy space, we not only build the best in class products but also recommend the right fit as per your needs and budget- a skillset that is rare to find. Our cost effective solar installations run effortlessly with minimum maintenance, providing a clean and effective energy solution to our clients.\",\"63860595-70df-4712-9a6c-e6e33d10a914\":\"10 KM Solar PV Plant\",\"a3d089fc-43a3-43ff-a3c2-707b0f2fcaf9\":\"Gorakhpur, UP\",\"06ebf062-5f30-493d-b9d1-66a76e1f01a3\":\"7.5 KM, Solar PV Plant\",\"b9e3baef-45fa-4393-96da-3f9601c9294e\":\"Jaipur (Chomu)\",\"c1a8f49a-ea90-4afc-8d58-dcd44d636095\":\"20 KM, Solar PV Plant\",\"85586cdb-f74e-45bf-8a62-760b2ceebd27\":\"Mumukshu Bhawan, Varanasi, UP\",\"1059a000-dbab-47e4-b0cd-93544b69bb2e\":\"Residential Projects\",\"b62c72cb-60bb-4b9f-b595-f3676d094c51\":\"Commercial Projects\",\"homeS12T4\":\"Know More\",\"contactUsTermsAndConditionsCheckboxtext\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\\"lgs-text-secondary-900 lgs-text-icon\\\"\\u003e\\n                                I acknowledge that I have read, understood, and agree to abide by the\\n                                \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/terms-and-conditions.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eterms and conditions\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                and\\n                                \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/privacy-policy.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eprivacy policy\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                outlined by the website.\",\"ormTrackingFormSubmit\":\"Submit\",\"6035024a-040b-4763-9347-29ce8fb402ea\":\"Contact Us\",\"6a1cc5f2-af32-474c-8676-6b851064daa1\":\"Livguard \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eSolar Diaries\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"865b7e53-039d-4ecc-9958-97f2527aecf7\":\"Rakesh Kansal\",\"8841827d-7aeb-4047-83ec-c4efd56a8586\":\"A solar solution built for expert performance and extra savings\",\"0602f1f2-b5aa-4f3e-b9c0-8e73dda79c19\":\"Being involved in the dairy business in Bikaner, Rajasthan, I was thinking about switching to solar for some time. After multiple enquiries about the right solar solution, one of my close friends advised me about the Livguard expert solar solution. Paying attention to his suggestion, I decided to install a 3KWp residential on-grid solar solution at home.\",\"c0caac80-005c-4acf-aa47-0262d063f5c5\":\"After making the first call with team Livguard, they guided me properly and helped in necessary government approvals and civil work. The entire installation process was a seamless experience due to the active team involvement.\",\"5a609ab9-7e6b-4707-8973-3cfe855555db\":\"Talking about the expert performance of my solar solution, it is generating around 12-13 units of electricity every day along with my less electricity bill. I am extremely satisfied with its overall working and it is clearly a true value for money.\",\"2f603908-119c-43b4-b4d3-8b372ed3828b\":\"Overall Satisfaction\",\"891acf4f-2644-4a44-b2a4-e845736ea7ac\":\"Call In The Experts!\",\"d60ae5a4-3948-4962-a6a2-2f0284c867ea\":\"Make Your Own Electricity\",\"b9301d8f-d133-4dfb-ad1e-c70d6e121d56\":\"Solar \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eCalculator\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"ed1957f8-4f19-4e09-9baa-b70752db69e8\":\"Choose any one of the following\",\"9e553c40-d8f3-43f0-9763-2996803abbd8\":\"Total Roof Top Area\",\"f318f992-25ad-4205-812d-dfaa816c8aa2\":\"Solar Panel Capacity you want to install\",\"3097c67f-83f4-49de-aaa3-e3904622263b\":\"Your Budget\",\"c5c679e6-c150-45dd-8b81-fb7cfb5c113e\":\"Select State and Customer Category\",\"670c54a1-db43-403f-ab97-a5b2fdfcc700\":\"Select State\",\"93d1b149-adc8-4bcb-88b0-d3a5aeecba5b\":\"Select Category of customer\",\"fe197d51-9577-41e7-8b71-10e4d91d4348\":\"What is your average Electricity Cost?\",\"948531e2-8aa8-4eb9-8dda-be211d33bfb0\":\"Calculate My Saving\",\"c12e9d8e-579a-465b-97ec-992cb1433286\":\"Get Solar, Tailored Perfectly\",\"3e6799b9-da2a-48a5-9363-56af3e3b42da\":\"Explore Our \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eCategories\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"fe5908ec-3337-4b25-814d-1324313fa03d\":\"Off-Grid Inverters\",\"9cafbfcc-4dc4-4a85-a168-bebb2bebcb84\":\"Hybrid Inverters\",\"feb2e012-474a-4ad1-a166-335db53d222f\":\"Charge Controller/SMU\",\"036fe73d-7d0c-4221-ae1d-3101139338c6\":\"Solar Battery\",\"a8e6287a-e537-4930-b85b-e2fef5f15bb6\":\"Accessories\",\"3e30b16d-e5ea-42f6-939a-f8e84f1de895\":\"Elevate your solar energy experience with Livguard Solar's MPPT inverters. Our advanced inverters offer noiseless and efficient operation, providing uninterrupted energy with their impressive overload capacity. Equipped with cutting-edge safety features, including smart thermal management and in-built protection mechanisms, Livguard Solar MPPT inverters ensure your peace of mind. \",\"d98255cb-8ee7-4524-b4ba-ff1082d1416a\":\"Experience limitless energy with our wide range range of automotive batteries, made to empower your fast-paced lifestyle with high performing products.\",\"79d987bd-8d6b-4727-b3e5-ed17bdda2e76\":\"Visit our range of home inverters with sleek design made to bring unlimited flow of energy to your home. Backed by its sturdy build, pick the one that suits your home the best.\",\"c10a56ed-8032-41ef-b0c6-711ca8d69003\":\"At Livguard, perfection is not an option, it's the only standard. Uncompromising quality is our promise. Livguard's refined manufacturing processes deliver reliable products every time.\",\"211b85f2-fe4c-4658-833e-a12091bd7c16\":\"With industry’s first 3D grid technology, our range of inverter batteries are manufactured to meet the power backup requirements of your family efficiently.\",\"972cc720-5731-4cf0-a9c9-84fa848acad3\":\"Solutions made to fit your specific needs, precisely. We are the experts in Solar Rooftop Solutions, which equip us to always bring the best in class products for your needs.\",\"75e5d73b-89c7-4ba0-a339-f0ccbee82d7e\":\"Explore accessories which perfectly compliment your products, with our curated range of choices. Built with the finest materials, these accessories will last long.\",\"1f7b8d21-f9bb-49a2-a3ca-ca43413141f7\":\"Explore accessories which perfectly compliment your products, with our curated range of choices. Built with the finest materials, these accessories will last long.\",\"a626d801-3333-4c0e-91a5-c58e2906bc17\":\"Know More\",\"4a3483db-1ef0-4363-b11c-0df4826acc4e\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eFeatured\\u003c/span\\u003e Solutions\",\"b6fd32e9-4eaa-4f00-9b37-99c4c6959e22\":\"Show Less\",\"04dea09c-912e-4573-9a7f-7f13ebd0d8f2\":\"View All Products\",\"d44ffe14-87dd-42e8-8550-0b82ac2dad04\":\"Download Catalogue\",\"7674034f-6ba5-49aa-8a27-0fb8076dd0c9\":\"1500VA Capacity\",\"34ac44bc-1ed5-40eb-898b-d9f3f3b1252a\":\"72 Months Warranty\",\"14e0e286-5fd7-43aa-a6f3-5b3b9a0ec71f\":\"Best Seller\",\"abce92ec-fd9a-4578-ab56-ddfd9fdafe72\":\"Starting from ₹\",\"0044b486-6eca-4e3a-abf0-102eede6e10c\":\"/-\",\"51a5666e-aa6d-47b8-b2e1-e6434066a5f6\":\"Why \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eLivguard Solar ?\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"25e4fa6b-c76f-44c6-a53a-dd09257e03ca\":\"India's Most Trusted Brand\",\"521eb4a5-fa32-4ac8-aa40-b8866848e565\":\"Pan India Presence\",\"2cd0daa3-cb41-4ed2-bf72-21c0cd92ddc6\":\"24X7 service support, for complete peace of mind\",\"da57a05a-f826-442a-b0e8-91318670ad45\":\"Scalable design for easy upgrades\",\"00cf9254-dac4-470b-b771-4372c52ef623\":\"Self-reliance\",\"35f02301-8477-44d7-8f6f-52a6f4abe2d4\":\"Green Commitment\",\"d5bc4f96-9b27-4542-aa8f-09e4d42b6ec7\":\"Lifecycle Asset Management\",\"6b0315ce-b5f4-4f33-8f0e-677d13a70260\":\"Use Solculator to check out available\",\"bd8a829c-9f84-4210-a080-7ecfb5f97f53\":\"Free Call and On-site consultation\",\"4fb13a5f-139e-4816-8229-c9aa05aa2962\":\"Design and Installation\",\"3bf2d179-a499-4679-82b0-7d25fc118ac1\":\"Congratulate \\u0026 enjoy your electricity savings.\",\"7eb2cee7-43b2-4fdc-89a3-96bb5c6e29e6\":\"Share your details in Solculator and evaluate the solutions with the comprehensive information. You can further calibrate the recommendations by providing details using Change option. Don't worry, if these details confuse you, our Solar Experts will anyway explain them to you. It is better if you familiarize yourselves with how solar works and what solutions are available before you use Solculator. Does it sound like too much of effort? You can always call us or fill out our contact form or visit any of our solar expert dealers nearby.\",\"89079cb8-768a-412a-b793-b7d9e995a6b3\":\"Share your details in Solculator and evaluate the solutions with the comprehensive information. You can further calibrate the recommendations by providing details using Change option. Don't worry, if these details confuse you, our Solar Experts will anyway explain them to you. It is better if you familiarize yourselves with how solar works and what solutions are available before you use Solculator. Does it sound like too much of effort? You can always call us or fill out our contact form or visit any of our solar expert dealers nearby.\",\"a1995e58-ae95-481d-82ec-432c89f6233b\":\"We offer 25 years of panel warranty \\u0026 a warranty of 7 years on inverter batteries for a longer, more durable life for solar solutions for you.\",\"0d67a0ff-5093-42ab-98ce-6caf471538fb\":\"A leader, a mentor, a visionary, and an overall driving force, Mr. Rakesh Malhotra's exposure to the industry, his passion and his spirit to bring new and innovative ideas to life continues to motivate many other entrepreneurs.\",\"eb177051-1e06-4803-a161-c75a46260e42\":\"Solar in \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eNews\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"97604440-7e23-422b-8923-698790e66060\":\"Solar benefit\",\"1270036f-b577-47f6-b17a-e6ced8a05eab\":\"Harnessing renewable energy sources contributes to creating a more   sustainable planet.\",\"ffc71191-6fbd-476c-8074-5e00400316d9\":\"Join hands with the solar energy experts. Together, we illuminate homes and communities, for a better tomorrow.\",\"8c99d6c2-d576-46ab-8454-56c7fd8ec299\":\"Understanding Solar\",\"42c75eff-708c-480f-9ad8-e132d1a6a165\":\"Dive deep into the world of solar. Equip yourself with knowledge and be empowered to make informed choices.\",\"c6368a30-03c7-4228-b694-cc1904df2c7a\":\"Dive Into \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eSolar\\n            \\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"bcb7af99-658d-4498-b32d-c07e6581912d\":\"Explore the World of Solar Energy with Livguard Solar.  Join hands with the solar energy experts. Understand in detail about the vast potential that Solar Energy holds, and Calculate and choose the ideal solar solution that would fit your home's unique energy requirements. Experience energy independence and create your own energy with us!\",\"0e9460fa-70dc-46e6-a7e9-eb390658befe\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eReach Out\\u003c/span\\u003e For Any Query\",\"70c4b348-67de-4873-bb1e-8d060f7d98c8\":\"Your Name\",\"5249c7c4-1840-410d-b6c7-f4c53ab8369a\":\"Please enter your name\",\"17cfa283-6fcc-4a49-9dfe-a392e0310b27\":\"Your Contact Number\",\"f8377f81-aafd-4082-9afd-ec2768af20be\":\"Change\",\"1e90dca7-b78f-4231-b2df-644a3b0322d1\":\"Enter Contact Number\",\"b3b8d172-823c-463a-85b6-45879381c677\":\"Get OTP\",\"0e5e1d39-fac0-4468-9424-5311cb9ac529\":\"Please Enter Your OTP\",\"8b41013f-a46d-44e9-9e78-ab865bbce0b1\":\"Invalid OTP\",\"ac40810c-65c9-4892-8625-1030acec3412\":\"Resend OTP\",\"1e26fc77-d6ce-496f-8a43-b0ff4d3f1f7e\":\"Your Email\",\"17b9c40e-9c7d-4a19-8202-b294967fdff8\":\"Please enter your email\",\"53927c84-bd54-4a11-b284-7f3844f30c4e\":\"Your Pin Code\",\"a73f6868-bb95-4bc4-9911-aed2ae6cc695\":\"Please enter your pin code\",\"5132b06f-9057-4e22-a21e-aca383247dda\":\"Your City\",\"154d8f5a-9084-4860-b588-c17bb178226e\":\"Please enter your city\",\"a677f88a-dabc-45d5-8542-9954d0c7535b\":\"Your State\",\"9fdfab81-7e99-4e76-8fbb-d1c3b634a735\":\"Please enter your state\",\"3b450c72-5fd5-49d7-bff9-6d8800f28f22\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\\"lgs-text-secondary-900 lgs-text-icon\\\"\\u003e\\n                                    I acknowledge that I have read, understood, and agree to abide by the\\n                                    \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/terms-and-conditions.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eterms and conditions\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                    and\\n                                    \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/privacy-policy.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eprivacy policy\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                    outlined by the website.\",\"7e5e1a8f-3016-4088-8f0e-c07ede31a6c1\":\"Submit\",\"6d0f2700-ee1b-4215-b60c-f920ba0d0a2b\":\"Thank You!\",\"d0b96a23-94c3-45c9-af3e-0722264c7ed5\":\"Hang on, our team will get in touch with you shortly.\",\"8a3404ac-d12b-47f2-bc31-5d9411a55fde\":\"Warranty Registration\",\"c7f4ccd4-fb4a-48d6-b8ab-76598c733b2c\":\"Register your Livguard Product online for complete peace of mind anytime, anywhere!\",\"644c26ab-1493-4cde-a5ad-1183d2bcec36\":\"Frequently Asked\",\"71a91e5e-6517-4f7a-bc21-8914b26d415d\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eQuestions\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"4ead628b-d2b7-4074-97a8-ab9e42d5ffb5\":\"Got questions on your mind?\",\"f8e7e843-5e67-4177-8262-5cc930c561e0\":\"Find your answers here\",\"d4ac8b7b-9434-4a41-a74c-6cf33517cffa\":\"Looking for service resolution?\",\"7ae1399e-8eb1-403b-a40a-1e4e295616f0\":\"Contact us at\",\"8e4a20c7-6b12-4eb3-b9ac-3c312dc88b05\":\"+91 18001025551\",\"8b841f59-4bf0-424a-bbac-e59ba2ca6141\":\"at any day of the week between 9 am to 6 pm, and our team will resolve it within 48 hours!\",\"ac8edbb9-bc3c-46b6-97cd-dd51105a423c\":\"What are inverter solar and how do they operate?\",\"c66fc5cd-3722-4b48-b7f4-243edd987db3\":\"What are inverter solar and how do they operate?\",\"0f565b14-a0df-46ca-91f2-96735f45b88e\":\"What are inverter solar and how do they operate?\",\"0acdb496-94a8-487b-a73d-829546437963\":\"Consider factors like power requirement, vehicle model, weather conditions, and regular usage. Livguard's range of truck battery offers high cranking power, superior performance and durability, making them an excellent choice for commercial trucks.\",\"3db5b6a7-0861-41ff-8d90-2ffbac60bf69\":\"How to select best battery for a diesel truck?\",\"4023e870-1e78-41f9-a528-2640381c5288\":\"Choosing a battery for a diesel truck involves considering power needs, engine size, and weather conditions. Livguard batteries, with high cranking power and exceptional durability, are well-suited to meet the needs of diesel trucks.\",\"e0581f37-46a0-472c-94e6-c7205e04d466\":\"Proper maintenance of a 24-volt truck battery includes regular cleaning, avoiding overcharging, and ensuring it stays adequately charged. Livguard's 24-volt truck batteries are designed for longevity and reliability, reducing the need for frequent maintenance.\",\"df814438-bb8d-441c-85b2-55609037be4f\":\"Will someone help me with my truck battery installation?\",\"e4e5ac1d-e5a5-4ae8-8a8b-3e05d9264d1b\":\"In order to get your truck battery installed, please contact your nearest mechanic or dealer point. Use our \\u003cspan class=\\\"tw-underline\\\"\\u003e \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/dealer-for-inverters-and-batteries\\\"\\u003e dealer locator \\u003c/a\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e to locator your nearest dealers within seconds.\",\"64eb212f-e988-4ec9-8cd9-c8af0bdb1f63\":\"Generally, a higher battery warranty means a better, and hassle-free lifetime of a bus and truck battery. Livguard bus and truck batteries come with the best in class warranty, of 24+24 months.\",\"8993dcbc-2216-4dd2-954e-e8145571049f\":\"View More\",\"fd9f1a5f-5d01-45cc-a223-c788b798c5ab\":\"40 Watt Power\",\"d33d8757-9fcc-4ea2-a13d-a9fe8d834b46\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"960885c5-6bcb-49fb-a3d5-18ba83100900\":\"50 Watt Power\",\"e1b43179-97f5-4328-93e9-7beda4ecc993\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"65e2c3b6-d393-4764-99c1-7ac3b3d35c97\":\"75 Watt Power\",\"46de0ebc-99f8-488d-8257-20775e022749\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"85bb0ea1-633d-4667-9d8c-21a78def05bd\":\"100 Watt Power\",\"2e026756-c03c-4cc9-b30b-335a5ec25ae2\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"28476b8e-f44b-4c8a-98d1-2ad6dd2466db\":\"160 Watt Power\",\"a0cc483a-f9fc-488e-a5e9-f3d87c6246e0\":\"60 Months Warranty\"},\"imageMetaDataLibrary\":{\"/livguard/icons/confirmation.png\":{\"width\":344,\"height\":306,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard/icons/confirmation-932b81.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/testimonials/smita.png\":{\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/testimonials/smita-6c3525.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/header/livguard-solar-logo.svg\":{\"width\":385,\"height\":96,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/header/livguard-solar-logo-b1f58e.svg\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-mobile.png\":{\"width\":1560,\"height\":2455,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-mobile-9ef13d.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-desktop.png\":{\"width\":2410,\"height\":1595,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-desktop-d0142a.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-india-flag.png\":{\"width\":194,\"height\":203,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-india-flag-c9ea25.png\"},\"/livgu