a82bd\":\"Bikaner, Rajasthan\",\"3606abd0-d276-4f45-a732-9783b400cb12\":\"Srinagar, Rajasthan\",\"2983a6e2-3c39-4c79-bc38-68eeeb9179e8\":\"50 KW, Solar PV Plant\",\"5fb6dae9-e71a-4bcd-930d-f011e443edf9\":\"Mewar University, Ghaziabad, UP\",\"a11142cf-bb40-464e-8c8f-98b61b7490ba\":\"20 KW, Solar PV Plant\",\"dde60104-112a-4410-ac02-8a8cad238964\":\"Unnao Development Authority, Unnao, UP\",\"ef03ae52-e01e-43ce-9d96-361aa4076400\":\"7.5 KW, Solar PV Plant\",\"329095b3-25a6-469f-a8bb-4cf67670f963\":\"GAIL, Haryana\",\"02c19cc1-c52c-4479-a2a2-996f2fc2084b\":\"of Your Energy Consumption\",\"071d5f91-3ac7-4c15-95e8-3351880f42de\":\"Bhatinda, Punjab\",\"725d04be-606e-4996-8646-a5ee273e0dc6\":\"Sultan Hussain\",\"836fa6bf-19d1-4624-8243-98bd440f531f\":\"A solar solution built for expert performance and extra savings\",\"fd28cf43-f2f5-4ae9-ac28-81ec78837d36\":\"Being involved in the dairy business in Bikaner, Rajasthan, I was thinking about switching to solar for some time. After multiple enquiries about the right solar solution, one of my close friends advised me about the Livguard expert solar solution. Paying attention to his suggestion, I decided to install a 3KWp residential on-grid solar solution at home.\",\"210ec741-d782-419b-b98d-a8518aaf99f4\":\"After making the first call with team Livguard, they guided me properly and helped in necessary government approvals and civil work. The entire installation process was a seamless experience due to the active team involvement.\",\"17d0208b-f5d5-4499-b803-f4533cb1814f\":\"Talking about the expert performance of my solar solution, it is generating around 12-13 units of electricity every day along with my less electricity bill. I am extremely satisfied with its overall working and it is clearly a true value for money.\",\"57bf7416-8cd8-40e8-a0b1-4a5111b18cd5\":\"Pintu Yadav\",\"5ff9b6ba-f968-41ab-892b-ba0f6dee5370\":\"An expert solar solution with an extraordinary after-sales service\",\"4c29fe0a-32e8-4515-abe7-87c9aa9fd12c\":\"While looking for a better energy solution for my shop, I was facing a major problem regarding which brand to choose. Further, being in the transport business, I had little time to search for the best solar brand. I came to know about Livguard expert solar solution via my known dealer. He explained the benefits in detail and offered me an end-to-end customized solar solution. After discussion with me and examination of my site, the Livguard team installed a commercial 8 KWp on-grid solar solution at my property.\",\"64906516-ed07-456c-b221-c42a95f6e930\":\"When I was contacted, the Livguard solar team carefully listened to my energy needs, answered my doubts, completed all paperwork, and ensured a smooth installation process. They also gave an excellent after-sales service.\",\"822b786a-71a3-45bf-801d-a661ed840289\":\"I am truly happy with my expert solar solution, as it reduced my electricity bill to half from 12000 to 6000. In the end, I would say that Livguard is worth it for people looking for a greener alternative for energy storage solutions.\",\"71f819cd-2095-41e9-b3cd-aa37be9a8c58\":\"Rakesh Kansal\",\"9559c524-04ba-440f-b52d-9e9a37dce983\":\"The promise of a trusted and expert solar brand\",\"1fbb0d76-34b9-4bad-9a92-f6eef2dfa7cc\":\"Working as a wholesaler in Bathinda, Punjab, I wanted an expert energy solution for my shop. While busy searching, a dealer/retailer in my area informed me about the multiple benefits of the Livguard solar solution. Confident of the best practices of Livguard because of my business relations with the group, I went for a 3.5 KVA commercial off-grid solar solution on its guidance.\",\"e47a3204-61ec-47a7-8c3d-ad35f0c77fc6\":\"The solar experts gave me clarity on everything, answered all my doubts, and involved my technicians in the installation process. The end-to-end installation activity was hassle-free. The service team was also very efficient, quickly resolving my requests.\",\"c1f6d85f-6fe1-426f-9562-5ae54e5f6ae8\":\"Satisfied with the overall performance of the solar solution, I went for a 10 KW 3 phase solar system for my home. Truly an excellent choice for investment as these solar solutions offer reduced electricity bills and maximum savings.\",\"7238734b-50c4-4b5a-8ff7-b626c07cfae7\":\"How is solar better than a Diesel Generator as a backup system?\",\"16115bea-5e43-4e71-a338-51052b0d49b3\":\"While the initial capital cost of a Solar PV System may be higher than that of a DG System, it's important to note that DG Systems incur substantial fuel and maintenance expenses. In contrast, Solar PV Systems require no fuel and involve minimal, hassle-free maintenance. \",\"b47adb32-02ea-4b96-8ff8-027f3ab143c0\":\"What maintenance is required for a solar energy system?\",\"40621e4a-65fb-42c4-b557-34949f00539a\":\"Solar systems require minimal maintenance, including occasional panel cleaning and inspections. Choose Livguard Solar, that ensures a hassle-free, efficient performance, and uninterrupted solar energy experience for you.\",\"bb6fb6af-288b-4a47-ae6d-36cd22d6bbb2\":\"How many solar panels do I need to power my home or business?\",\"62f1f42d-24fa-4d26-a4ac-d2032e5c1179\":\"The number of solar panels required varies based on energy consumption. Livguard Solar's experts help you determine the ideal setup, ensuring cost-effective, sustainable power. Connect with us to book a consultation.\",\"8961c7db-cbe3-400a-9f73-14f4e95d8e02\":\"Can I install solar panels on my roof if it has a unique shape or material?\",\"cc4bdf52-e66b-42b8-8468-19a308d4eb94\":\"Yes, solar panels can be customized to fit unique roof shapes and materials. At Livguard Solar, we offer tailor-fit solutions for you, based on the specific needs and requirements of your home.\",\"68955053-639a-4297-96c6-e4b53a4e0830\":\"Can I retrofit my existing solar panel system with an energy storage solution?\",\"c0ccfb1d-669b-46b6-984c-9584dc2893d9\":\"Yes, existing solar panel systems can be retrofitted with energy storage solutions. Our Solar Management Units convert the existing inverter battery into a Solar inverter battery a budget-friendly solution retrofitted to your current setup.\",\"adcb6696-3d4f-445a-b8cf-e7c8767d8e13\":\"Please enter your contact number\",\"548fd85f-3f3c-492a-a844-aa7880a94aff\":\"We Are Here \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eFor You\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"33b74039-09ef-4c20-8d11-49e51b05bac3\":\" Trusted Solar Expertise\",\"0c94ccb6-706b-4743-aaf6-605823b8f6c8\":\"Tailor-fit Energy Solutions\",\"807ce100-4d2f-4f0a-92e4-05159231e5fa\":\"Cutting-Edge Technology\",\"f3e3bd87-71a6-488a-bc6c-db38aee8e5bb\":\" Harnessing Green Energy\",\"18a3066a-2972-4ece-9954-226982aa539c\":\"Empowering Self-sufficiency\",\"b293d55a-8e5e-4a19-b0ff-a3fa70592122\":\"Our \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eFeatured\\u003c/span\\u003e Products\",\"8cc6a456-91f8-459f-a515-25434ac916a3\":\"Step into a brighter tomorrow with Livguard's solar panels crafted specially for your needs. Experience unmatched efficiency, reliability, and a sustainable energy solution that complements your lifestyle with limitless energy.\",\"a4bda8b3-77f1-4dec-8afa-326f63e5581d\":\"Experience uninterrupted energy freedom with Livguard Solar's Off-Grid Inverters. Enjoy reliable, noiseless power for your home, harnessing solar energy efficiently. Our smart inverters ensure peace of mind with built-in safety features and real-time energy optimization, making your solar journey effortless and secure.\",\"b9c27782-629f-4140-bbed-4fcf664c7e97\":\"Embrace solar energy like never before with Livguard's On-Grid Inverters. Designed for seamless integration of solar power into your home, delivering efficient, reliable energy while reducing your electricity bills, our on-grid inverters offer a modern and effortless solar experience, backed by a 10-year warranty for your peace of mind.\",\"416af5ed-9a81-4b76-9859-e671f309d0db\":\"Elevate your home's energy game with Livguard's Solar Battery. Crafted for durability, consistent performance, and featuring a 3D mesh design for extended life, our battery ensures your lights stay on and appliances run smoothly.\",\"67ee940a-2386-49c9-adcc-f14553b107ed\":\"Empower your solar journey with Livguard's Solar Charge Controller (SCC). Crafted to optimize and regulate energy flow, our Charge Controller ensures that your batteries charge efficiently and safely.\",\"9cb24a8d-0b30-490c-88a4-a68cb2aaf3ca\":\"Power up with Livguard's Solar Management Unit (SMU). Tailored for every home, our SMU converts your existing inverter battery into Solar inverter battery, making a budget-friendly solution retrofitted to your current setup.\",\"e0423bae-28fe-4dbb-a7e2-d24b9f8d9743\":\"Illuminate your streets with Livguard Solar's street lights. Offering a sustainable solution for your community, these lights not only enhance safety but also reflect a commitment to a greener tomorrow, made by the experts.\",\"8345cb63-9454-4b9f-a06a-405e3c6f35b5\":\"Solar Panel\",\"0135d533-c46e-4345-901d-5e90acb36163\":\"Solar Grid\",\"52530b20-4bcb-4db8-97fb-51baa510f944\":\"Solar Batteries\",\"dcd997f3-51bf-450c-a4f4-01881229e4a8\":\"Solar Charge Controller\",\"ec670e52-190b-4154-8c13-378cb1515755\":\"Solar Inverter\",\"737f7183-4d97-4914-88a0-74e25899ad2c\":\"Solar Management Unit\",\"ca479b58-611b-4bbf-9dd8-3b6895b073e0\":\"Solar Street Lights\",\"4ecda2d1-617a-4bb6-8709-a3ba465dfc2b\":\"With years of experience in the energy field, we don't just create solar energy solutions, we customise them according to your unique needs. This rare skill set sets us apart. Our affordable solar setups work smoothly with little upkeep, providing you with clean and efficient energy, for an experience that is powered with uninterrupted energy!\",\"05889c30-2051-4c7b-80e5-5a855eb07302\":\"Powering Your Life, \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eWith The Experts\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"ff94b605-967a-479d-b556-70e8044394a5\":\"Is Solar Right For Your Home?\",\"0cbe88bc-e28d-4187-ad1b-a5da5304c753\":\"Picture yourself with significantly lower electricity bills and uninterrupted power, just like a steady stream. Livguard Solar makes it happen by harnessing solar energy, leading to substantial savings. Bid farewell to those high electricity costs and welcome reliable, budget-friendly energy into your everyday life.\",\"958c5d29-5d2b-44e9-a6db-da5ef371936a\":\"Escape the burden of ever-increasing electricity costs and enjoy financial relief. Livguard Solar provides a shield against rising expenses, like finding shelter from the storm. By harnessing the sun's energy, we offer substantial savings, ensuring that your budget remains secure while enjoying uninterrupted power.\",\"69ecb3c2-10b5-4710-9e6e-f167c650ba19\":\"Embrace noise-free, effortlessly manageable, and custom-tailored solutions. With Livguard Solar, you welcome systems that operate quietly and require minimal maintenance. Our tailor-fit approach ensures your specific needs are met, providing peace of mind and limitless energy for your home or business.\",\"2560e0b9-94f8-469e-be5a-283bce1d4440\":\"Indulge in hassle-free maintenance for an energy experience without bounds. With Livguard Solar as your energy partner, say goodbye to the hassle of constant maintenance, and say hello to a limitless source of energy for your home or business, at all times.\",\"30913e1c-4543-4c16-9fe4-42dbabbe0167\":\"Experience the natural cooling effect of rooftop solar panels, right at your home. Livguard Solar's roof-mounted panels provide a refreshing experience, keeping your space cool and comfortable while harnessing clean and uninterrupted energy for your needs.\",\"6624d6da-e54e-401b-b8e6-dc9cf1230692\":\"Join hands with the experts to construct a brighter, more sustainable future. We're your trusted partners in building a greener tomorrow. Our expertise in harnessing solar energy paves the way for a cleaner, more sustainable world. Together, let's create a future where environmental responsibility and energy efficiency go hand in hand.\",\"fed8aab1-0534-4855-8f7e-7d3e8372ec36\":\"Reduced Bills\",\"24a03ab9-11f2-4124-ab6e-f81d0f6517ca\":\"Better Savings\",\"ca726612-45ea-46dc-b75a-34c149ef1983\":\"Seamless Operation\",\"57d365ad-7216-4603-915a-d4bf85250d74\":\"Low Maintenance\",\"e34c4ccc-b800-47c9-bef0-33dd2ad42f24\":\"Enhanced Experience\",\"3aee1898-9ce2-4645-9224-0e618ac5db86\":\"Sustainable Energy\",\"03ccdaa3-1eaf-4ffa-8851-aab6ab979092\":\"SOLCULATOR®\",\"6375ea81-512b-4b44-9f2a-0e81ba92e8c4\":\"Find Your \\u003cbr /\\u003eIdeal Solar Solution\",\"f4f34fd4-f3af-4919-8d49-30bbb470d211\":\"Using the decades of research in the energy space, we not only build the best in class products but also recommend the right fit as per your needs and budget- a skillset that is rare to find. Our cost effective solar installations run effortlessly with minimum maintenance, providing a clean and effective energy solution to our clients.\",\"10a749b0-d7b2-4c29-add5-a4afb989249d\":\"View More\",\"3280fde0-f2d3-4627-b829-5956d59109a3\":\"Calculate My Savings\",\"8d13552e-dbed-448b-bdb1-f62f360e4237\":\"What Sets Us Apart?\",\"8fd0b5be-f173-41dd-b9d3-3deddb5c11ba\":\"Tailor-fit solutions made for your unique needs\",\"25fd206a-06bb-4672-a35f-1399865203d4\":\"End-to-End Installation\",\"d791b39f-14fd-4c40-8433-ec925424664f\":\"Real-Time Monitoring with LivMonitor 360\",\"e37bfec4-dc83-429c-9a67-7071555b9e59\":\"One Click Service Support\",\"304bb4e0-bdb6-4262-962d-38e6a7da770c\":\"Why Go \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eSolar?\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"cdd10c2f-5e3b-422c-82a0-0bab45cdc28b\":\"Reduce your electricity Bill\",\"afd8b2c4-4569-40e8-80c8-51cbdaf216aa\":\"Renewable energy contribute to a Greener Planet to avoid natural disaster\",\"99f54955-32c7-4a5e-adb0-042ff473e4b6\":\"Protection against rising Electricity cost\",\"773154e0-c198-4bbe-8217-b32405b19f49\":\"Lower maintenance cost compare to other electricity generation system\",\"9b537612-c051-4b32-8430-ac84431b06da\":\"Noise free, easy to maintain\",\"0306168f-91be-4091-8a51-8b714976fd51\":\"Natural cooling due to roof mounted solar Panels\",\"80c6554e-9b6f-40a0-b2d1-66dc980523eb\":\"Answer to your big Question\",\"ea9fdf49-ad11-4d5a-9a12-73dc0de5d1f1\":\"Should I Get Solar?\",\"c9ab50c2-797b-45e5-af4d-91b3a9b475d0\":\"Area Required\",\"f863e274-dbb8-4d2f-8afb-f0e855d66600\":\"*Ideal system size. Final solution post site survey\",\"cca0be55-8a1e-414a-bedf-4503980a95f1\":\"Your Monthly Bill \\u003cspan class=\\\"tw-text-primary-500-light\\\"\\u003ewith Solar\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"ec96e9b6-7bba-4a4f-915c-c8134c03fbb5\":\"Your Monthly Saving \\u003cspan class=\\\"tw-text-primary-500-light\\\"\\u003ewith Solar\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"6940b06d-192b-4c64-a38d-39c08ba585ec\":\"Your Solar System Can generate\",\"b9d9380d-e638-47f6-8a9f-3c9aa6c5d485\":\"of your \\u003cspan class=\\\"tw-text-primary-500-light\\\"\\u003eEnergy Consumption\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"6db60a24-510a-443d-a7e4-9de505a047ac\":\"Your Lifetime Saving\",\"f2dcb78d-2566-465a-ac08-df42e2ed8a45\":\"Your Estimate For Solar Solution\",\"1228daec-fb96-4fa6-8760-818d97a7cf83\":\"Payback\",\"673c90b0-b6fb-4ddd-9e0e-b8f6e1abdbae\":\"Return on Investment\",\"549aaae6-7b4f-4bea-8f89-4254d36fb069\":\"Your Solar System Can Generate\",\"378c005c-263e-436e-a034-1e8b4b121f50\":\"Impact on Environment\",\"4723e954-2c41-42a9-ab54-69f518c422fd\":\"CO2 Emissions Mitigated\",\"3dfa0f92-bb81-4e09-9f25-92ad66afa93b\":\"Trees Added\",\"8b2953ed-b530-499e-a3fe-92e64d0bba76\":\"1 BHK Home\",\"f900391f-bcad-4185-adf2-ec61b74662fe\":\"2 BHK Home\",\"fb4c3130-3c4e-4f47-984d-977afcdd8380\":\"3 BHK Home\",\"68f6bb6e-b78e-4b1d-86d3-8eb004ee22cf\":\"How Our \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted tw-whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\u003eSolar Experts Deliver?\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"2768e014-aad2-4622-a7e0-39cd685d5be9\":\"Using the decades of research in the energy space, we not only build the best in class products but also recommend the right fit as per your needs and budget- a skillset that is rare to find. Our cost effective solar installations run effortlessly with minimum maintenance, providing a clean and effective energy solution to our clients.\",\"63860595-70df-4712-9a6c-e6e33d10a914\":\"10 KM Solar PV Plant\",\"a3d089fc-43a3-43ff-a3c2-707b0f2fcaf9\":\"Gorakhpur, UP\",\"06ebf062-5f30-493d-b9d1-66a76e1f01a3\":\"7.5 KM, Solar PV Plant\",\"b9e3baef-45fa-4393-96da-3f9601c9294e\":\"Jaipur (Chomu)\",\"c1a8f49a-ea90-4afc-8d58-dcd44d636095\":\"20 KM, Solar PV Plant\",\"85586cdb-f74e-45bf-8a62-760b2ceebd27\":\"Mumukshu Bhawan, Varanasi, UP\",\"1059a000-dbab-47e4-b0cd-93544b69bb2e\":\"Residential Projects\",\"b62c72cb-60bb-4b9f-b595-f3676d094c51\":\"Commercial Projects\",\"homeS12T4\":\"Know More\",\"contactUsTermsAndConditionsCheckboxtext\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\\"lgs-text-secondary-900 lgs-text-icon\\\"\\u003e\\n                                I acknowledge that I have read, understood, and agree to abide by the\\n                                \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/terms-and-conditions.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eterms and conditions\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                and\\n                                \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/privacy-policy.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eprivacy policy\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                outlined by the website.\",\"ormTrackingFormSubmit\":\"Submit\",\"6035024a-040b-4763-9347-29ce8fb402ea\":\"Contact Us\",\"6a1cc5f2-af32-474c-8676-6b851064daa1\":\"Livguard \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eSolar Diaries\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"865b7e53-039d-4ecc-9958-97f2527aecf7\":\"Rakesh Kansal\",\"8841827d-7aeb-4047-83ec-c4efd56a8586\":\"A solar solution built for expert performance and extra savings\",\"0602f1f2-b5aa-4f3e-b9c0-8e73dda79c19\":\"Being involved in the dairy business in Bikaner, Rajasthan, I was thinking about switching to solar for some time. After multiple enquiries about the right solar solution, one of my close friends advised me about the Livguard expert solar solution. Paying attention to his suggestion, I decided to install a 3KWp residential on-grid solar solution at home.\",\"c0caac80-005c-4acf-aa47-0262d063f5c5\":\"After making the first call with team Livguard, they guided me properly and helped in necessary government approvals and civil work. The entire installation process was a seamless experience due to the active team involvement.\",\"5a609ab9-7e6b-4707-8973-3cfe855555db\":\"Talking about the expert performance of my solar solution, it is generating around 12-13 units of electricity every day along with my less electricity bill. I am extremely satisfied with its overall working and it is clearly a true value for money.\",\"2f603908-119c-43b4-b4d3-8b372ed3828b\":\"Overall Satisfaction\",\"891acf4f-2644-4a44-b2a4-e845736ea7ac\":\"Call In The Experts!\",\"d60ae5a4-3948-4962-a6a2-2f0284c867ea\":\"Make Your Own Electricity\",\"b9301d8f-d133-4dfb-ad1e-c70d6e121d56\":\"Solar \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eCalculator\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"ed1957f8-4f19-4e09-9baa-b70752db69e8\":\"Choose any one of the following\",\"9e553c40-d8f3-43f0-9763-2996803abbd8\":\"Total Roof Top Area\",\"f318f992-25ad-4205-812d-dfaa816c8aa2\":\"Solar Panel Capacity you want to install\",\"3097c67f-83f4-49de-aaa3-e3904622263b\":\"Your Budget\",\"c5c679e6-c150-45dd-8b81-fb7cfb5c113e\":\"Select State and Customer Category\",\"670c54a1-db43-403f-ab97-a5b2fdfcc700\":\"Select State\",\"93d1b149-adc8-4bcb-88b0-d3a5aeecba5b\":\"Select Category of customer\",\"fe197d51-9577-41e7-8b71-10e4d91d4348\":\"What is your average Electricity Cost?\",\"948531e2-8aa8-4eb9-8dda-be211d33bfb0\":\"Calculate My Saving\",\"c12e9d8e-579a-465b-97ec-992cb1433286\":\"Get Solar, Tailored Perfectly\",\"3e6799b9-da2a-48a5-9363-56af3e3b42da\":\"Explore Our \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eCategories\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"fe5908ec-3337-4b25-814d-1324313fa03d\":\"Off-Grid Inverters\",\"9cafbfcc-4dc4-4a85-a168-bebb2bebcb84\":\"Hybrid Inverters\",\"feb2e012-474a-4ad1-a166-335db53d222f\":\"Charge Controller/SMU\",\"036fe73d-7d0c-4221-ae1d-3101139338c6\":\"Solar Battery\",\"a8e6287a-e537-4930-b85b-e2fef5f15bb6\":\"Accessories\",\"3e30b16d-e5ea-42f6-939a-f8e84f1de895\":\"Elevate your solar energy experience with Livguard Solar's MPPT inverters. Our advanced inverters offer noiseless and efficient operation, providing uninterrupted energy with their impressive overload capacity. Equipped with cutting-edge safety features, including smart thermal management and in-built protection mechanisms, Livguard Solar MPPT inverters ensure your peace of mind. \",\"d98255cb-8ee7-4524-b4ba-ff1082d1416a\":\"Experience limitless energy with our wide range range of automotive batteries, made to empower your fast-paced lifestyle with high performing products.\",\"79d987bd-8d6b-4727-b3e5-ed17bdda2e76\":\"Visit our range of home inverters with sleek design made to bring unlimited flow of energy to your home. Backed by its sturdy build, pick the one that suits your home the best.\",\"c10a56ed-8032-41ef-b0c6-711ca8d69003\":\"At Livguard, perfection is not an option, it's the only standard. Uncompromising quality is our promise. Livguard's refined manufacturing processes deliver reliable products every time.\",\"211b85f2-fe4c-4658-833e-a12091bd7c16\":\"With industry’s first 3D grid technology, our range of inverter batteries are manufactured to meet the power backup requirements of your family efficiently.\",\"972cc720-5731-4cf0-a9c9-84fa848acad3\":\"Solutions made to fit your specific needs, precisely. We are the experts in Solar Rooftop Solutions, which equip us to always bring the best in class products for your needs.\",\"75e5d73b-89c7-4ba0-a339-f0ccbee82d7e\":\"Explore accessories which perfectly compliment your products, with our curated range of choices. Built with the finest materials, these accessories will last long.\",\"1f7b8d21-f9bb-49a2-a3ca-ca43413141f7\":\"Explore accessories which perfectly compliment your products, with our curated range of choices. Built with the finest materials, these accessories will last long.\",\"a626d801-3333-4c0e-91a5-c58e2906bc17\":\"Know More\",\"4a3483db-1ef0-4363-b11c-0df4826acc4e\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eFeatured\\u003c/span\\u003e Solutions\",\"b6fd32e9-4eaa-4f00-9b37-99c4c6959e22\":\"Show Less\",\"04dea09c-912e-4573-9a7f-7f13ebd0d8f2\":\"View All Products\",\"d44ffe14-87dd-42e8-8550-0b82ac2dad04\":\"Download Catalogue\",\"7674034f-6ba5-49aa-8a27-0fb8076dd0c9\":\"1500VA Capacity\",\"34ac44bc-1ed5-40eb-898b-d9f3f3b1252a\":\"72 Months Warranty\",\"14e0e286-5fd7-43aa-a6f3-5b3b9a0ec71f\":\"Best Seller\",\"abce92ec-fd9a-4578-ab56-ddfd9fdafe72\":\"Starting from ₹\",\"0044b486-6eca-4e3a-abf0-102eede6e10c\":\"/-\",\"51a5666e-aa6d-47b8-b2e1-e6434066a5f6\":\"Why \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eLivguard Solar ?\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"25e4fa6b-c76f-44c6-a53a-dd09257e03ca\":\"India's Most Trusted Brand\",\"521eb4a5-fa32-4ac8-aa40-b8866848e565\":\"Pan India Presence\",\"2cd0daa3-cb41-4ed2-bf72-21c0cd92ddc6\":\"24X7 service support, for complete peace of mind\",\"da57a05a-f826-442a-b0e8-91318670ad45\":\"Scalable design for easy upgrades\",\"00cf9254-dac4-470b-b771-4372c52ef623\":\"Self-reliance\",\"35f02301-8477-44d7-8f6f-52a6f4abe2d4\":\"Green Commitment\",\"d5bc4f96-9b27-4542-aa8f-09e4d42b6ec7\":\"Lifecycle Asset Management\",\"6b0315ce-b5f4-4f33-8f0e-677d13a70260\":\"Use Solculator to check out available\",\"bd8a829c-9f84-4210-a080-7ecfb5f97f53\":\"Free Call and On-site consultation\",\"4fb13a5f-139e-4816-8229-c9aa05aa2962\":\"Design and Installation\",\"3bf2d179-a499-4679-82b0-7d25fc118ac1\":\"Congratulate \\u0026 enjoy your electricity savings.\",\"7eb2cee7-43b2-4fdc-89a3-96bb5c6e29e6\":\"Share your details in Solculator and evaluate the solutions with the comprehensive information. You can further calibrate the recommendations by providing details using Change option. Don't worry, if these details confuse you, our Solar Experts will anyway explain them to you. It is better if you familiarize yourselves with how solar works and what solutions are available before you use Solculator. Does it sound like too much of effort? You can always call us or fill out our contact form or visit any of our solar expert dealers nearby.\",\"89079cb8-768a-412a-b793-b7d9e995a6b3\":\"Share your details in Solculator and evaluate the solutions with the comprehensive information. You can further calibrate the recommendations by providing details using Change option. Don't worry, if these details confuse you, our Solar Experts will anyway explain them to you. It is better if you familiarize yourselves with how solar works and what solutions are available before you use Solculator. Does it sound like too much of effort? You can always call us or fill out our contact form or visit any of our solar expert dealers nearby.\",\"a1995e58-ae95-481d-82ec-432c89f6233b\":\"We offer 25 years of panel warranty \\u0026 a warranty of 7 years on inverter batteries for a longer, more durable life for solar solutions for you.\",\"0d67a0ff-5093-42ab-98ce-6caf471538fb\":\"A leader, a mentor, a visionary, and an overall driving force, Mr. Rakesh Malhotra's exposure to the industry, his passion and his spirit to bring new and innovative ideas to life continues to motivate many other entrepreneurs.\",\"eb177051-1e06-4803-a161-c75a46260e42\":\"Solar in \\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eNews\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"97604440-7e23-422b-8923-698790e66060\":\"Solar benefit\",\"1270036f-b577-47f6-b17a-e6ced8a05eab\":\"Harnessing renewable energy sources contributes to creating a more   sustainable planet.\",\"ffc71191-6fbd-476c-