\",\"9fdfab81-7e99-4e76-8fbb-d1c3b634a735\":\"Please enter your state\",\"3b450c72-5fd5-49d7-bff9-6d8800f28f22\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\\"lgs-text-secondary-900 lgs-text-icon\\\"\\u003e\\n                                    I acknowledge that I have read, understood, and agree to abide by the\\n                                    \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/terms-and-conditions.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eterms and conditions\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                    and\\n                                    \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/privacy-policy.php\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-semibold\\\"\\u003eprivacy policy\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n                                    outlined by the website.\",\"7e5e1a8f-3016-4088-8f0e-c07ede31a6c1\":\"Submit\",\"6d0f2700-ee1b-4215-b60c-f920ba0d0a2b\":\"Thank You!\",\"d0b96a23-94c3-45c9-af3e-0722264c7ed5\":\"Hang on, our team will get in touch with you shortly.\",\"8a3404ac-d12b-47f2-bc31-5d9411a55fde\":\"Warranty Registration\",\"c7f4ccd4-fb4a-48d6-b8ab-76598c733b2c\":\"Register your Livguard Product online for complete peace of mind anytime, anywhere!\",\"644c26ab-1493-4cde-a5ad-1183d2bcec36\":\"Frequently Asked\",\"71a91e5e-6517-4f7a-bc21-8914b26d415d\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\\"lgs-text-highlighted\\\"\\u003eQuestions\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"4ead628b-d2b7-4074-97a8-ab9e42d5ffb5\":\"Got questions on your mind?\",\"f8e7e843-5e67-4177-8262-5cc930c561e0\":\"Find your answers here\",\"d4ac8b7b-9434-4a41-a74c-6cf33517cffa\":\"Looking for service resolution?\",\"7ae1399e-8eb1-403b-a40a-1e4e295616f0\":\"Contact us at\",\"8e4a20c7-6b12-4eb3-b9ac-3c312dc88b05\":\"+91 18001025551\",\"8b841f59-4bf0-424a-bbac-e59ba2ca6141\":\"at any day of the week between 9 am to 6 pm, and our team will resolve it within 48 hours!\",\"ac8edbb9-bc3c-46b6-97cd-dd51105a423c\":\"What are inverter solar and how do they operate?\",\"c66fc5cd-3722-4b48-b7f4-243edd987db3\":\"What are inverter solar and how do they operate?\",\"0f565b14-a0df-46ca-91f2-96735f45b88e\":\"What are inverter solar and how do they operate?\",\"0acdb496-94a8-487b-a73d-829546437963\":\"Consider factors like power requirement, vehicle model, weather conditions, and regular usage. Livguard's range of truck battery offers high cranking power, superior performance and durability, making them an excellent choice for commercial trucks.\",\"3db5b6a7-0861-41ff-8d90-2ffbac60bf69\":\"How to select best battery for a diesel truck?\",\"4023e870-1e78-41f9-a528-2640381c5288\":\"Choosing a battery for a diesel truck involves considering power needs, engine size, and weather conditions. Livguard batteries, with high cranking power and exceptional durability, are well-suited to meet the needs of diesel trucks.\",\"e0581f37-46a0-472c-94e6-c7205e04d466\":\"Proper maintenance of a 24-volt truck battery includes regular cleaning, avoiding overcharging, and ensuring it stays adequately charged. Livguard's 24-volt truck batteries are designed for longevity and reliability, reducing the need for frequent maintenance.\",\"df814438-bb8d-441c-85b2-55609037be4f\":\"Will someone help me with my truck battery installation?\",\"e4e5ac1d-e5a5-4ae8-8a8b-3e05d9264d1b\":\"In order to get your truck battery installed, please contact your nearest mechanic or dealer point. Use our \\u003cspan class=\\\"tw-underline\\\"\\u003e \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.livguard.com/dealer-for-inverters-and-batteries\\\"\\u003e dealer locator \\u003c/a\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e to locator your nearest dealers within seconds.\",\"64eb212f-e988-4ec9-8cd9-c8af0bdb1f63\":\"Generally, a higher battery warranty means a better, and hassle-free lifetime of a bus and truck battery. Livguard bus and truck batteries come with the best in class warranty, of 24+24 months.\",\"8993dcbc-2216-4dd2-954e-e8145571049f\":\"View More\",\"fd9f1a5f-5d01-45cc-a223-c788b798c5ab\":\"40 Watt Power\",\"d33d8757-9fcc-4ea2-a13d-a9fe8d834b46\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"960885c5-6bcb-49fb-a3d5-18ba83100900\":\"50 Watt Power\",\"e1b43179-97f5-4328-93e9-7beda4ecc993\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"65e2c3b6-d393-4764-99c1-7ac3b3d35c97\":\"75 Watt Power\",\"46de0ebc-99f8-488d-8257-20775e022749\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"85bb0ea1-633d-4667-9d8c-21a78def05bd\":\"100 Watt Power\",\"2e026756-c03c-4cc9-b30b-335a5ec25ae2\":\"60 Months Warranty\",\"28476b8e-f44b-4c8a-98d1-2ad6dd2466db\":\"160 Watt Power\",\"a0cc483a-f9fc-488e-a5e9-f3d87c6246e0\":\"60 Months Warranty\"},\"imageMetaDataLibrary\":{\"/livguard/icons/confirmation.png\":{\"width\":344,\"height\":306,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard/icons/confirmation-932b81.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/testimonials/smita.png\":{\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/testimonials/smita-6c3525.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/header/livguard-solar-logo.svg\":{\"width\":385,\"height\":96,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/header/livguard-solar-logo-b1f58e.svg\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-mobile.png\":{\"width\":1560,\"height\":2455,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-mobile-9ef13d.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-desktop.png\":{\"width\":2410,\"height\":1595,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-pattern-desktop-d0142a.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-india-flag.png\":{\"width\":194,\"height\":203,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/8/we-are-everywhere-india-flag-c9ea25.png\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/4/capacity_icon.svg\":{\"width\":12,\"height\":22,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/4/capacity_icon-3a5208.svg\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/4/warranty_icon.svg\":{\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/4/warranty_icon-e7e2b6.svg\"},\"/livguard-solar/home/5/use-solculator.png\":{\"width\":680,\"height\":384,\"finalUrl\":\"/livguard-solar/home/5/use-solculator-9d0ebe.png\"},\"/